hpc:FullyQualifiedHostname a owl:Class .
hpc:strippedHostname a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:FullyQualifiedHostname ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:bulkLaunchTemporaryFile1HostLines a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:HPCSystem ;
    rdfs:range hpc:FullyQualifiedHostname .
```

Assuming `HPCSystem` is a pre-existing class in the ontology.
